5,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I believe we should be cautious about the long-term financial sustainability of these programs. I'll start by checking the budget and tariffs.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,"Sustainability is a simple matter of numbers. I am more interested in whether our previous ""innovations"" actually achieved anything.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I agree that we need a balanced approach. I'm worried about how these programs affect the staff on the ground, so I'll look into that.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I'm excited to see the ideas! But I wonder if we have enough space and time for them. I'll check the logistics first.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It is so lovely to see everyone so passionate. I just want to make sure we don't overpromise and leave our dear colleagues feeling overwhelmed later.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,pass,Jonathan,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Jonathan, numbers are useful, but they don't tell us if the patients actually benefited. We shouldn't just add to the pile.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shion, that's a very fair point. It's important that the people implementing the program are actually the ones who can handle it.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Midori, exactly! If the hallways are too crowded or the booking system crashes, it won't matter how good the idea is.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"You all make such wonderful points. I think I shall look into where our previous efforts might have stumbled, just to be safe.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
